==Battleground==
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Prude]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*6 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
